{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791316680, "covers_from": "2026-10-06T19:58:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-06T19:59:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791316740, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-06T19:58:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 56259, "sprite_key": "turtle_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "長照", "content": "少子化+高齡化的台北，青年負擔愈來愈沈重。長輩領有重大傷病卡，卻因未滿法定老人年限，不符合長照資格。", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.56,259", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T19:58:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30982, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "我住林口，每天來信義區上班。每天回家開車都得1小時。其中超過20分鐘在排隊上高速公路，這能解決嗎", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.30,982", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T19:58:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16484, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "育兒", "content": "下班時間都晚了實在沒辦法自己接送小孩，有辦法解決嗎", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.16,484", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-06T19:58:38+00:00", "duration_seconds": 22, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28962, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "體育", "content": "運動中心的設備和維護也太爛，器材老舊克難，故障率高又要等很久才能修好，能讓市民有舒適的運動環境嗎？", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.28,962", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 30982, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.30,982", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 16484, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.16,484", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 28962, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.28,962", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 33597, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name